  "description": "As the sole princess of the empire, Vishnahel had her life all planned out until she was brutally executed. Thanks to her family’s ancestral god, she’s sent back in time… to live as her 5-year-old self! In order to restore glory to the empire, she must raise hell, team up with her new adopted father (whom she met in prison), and gather the most unlikely allies. With this first-time dad under her thumb, she’s about to prove that sometimes the best way to win is to break all the rules!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
